SkillBuilder 2: Building a Game / charity: water
Project: Build the charity: water Game Concept

*Note: The Water Quest game (https://water-quest--jyu2029.replit.app/) "expires" every 30 days because I'm not a Replit "core" member. Requires republishing.

YOUR TASK

Create a visual and written plan for a game idea that raises awareness about access to clean water. Plan the game’s layout, user interaction, and visual feedback, 
using AI to help brainstorm mechanics, scoring systems, or interactive features. Think through the game logic and visual design, and find opportunities to incorporate charity: water's branding.
As a Strategy Associate last week, you designed a landing page for charity: water aimed at connecting with college students and inspiring them to take action on the global water crisis. 
Now it’s time to bring that design to life. Together with Rita, their marketing team decided to explore a new program: a mobile game that would offer students at partnering universities 
on-campus rewards (e.g. cafeteria discounts) for game points.
